MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Fab_m01_001: There is a point of interest quite near Dagsion, as I\nnow recall.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Fab_m01_002: This is my chance to pay it a visit.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_Fab_m01: <BLN>An opportunity presents itself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Esm_m01_001: My whole life, I've never been outside of Fina.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Esm_m01_002: I am a fisher, and I've sailed out plenty of\ntimes, though.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Esm_m01_003: So while I haven't really been anywhere else, I\nhaven't stayed glued to Fina either!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_Esm_m01: <BLN>Come to think of it...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Crn_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Crn_m01_001: I can't show my face to Esme now.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Crn_m01_002: Any mother who'd let her child get taken away\ndoesn't deserve to see her again.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_Crn_m01_003: *sob*
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_Crn_m01: <BLN>Esmeralda...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B01_m01_001: There's been a landslide from all the rain lately.\nThe road to the east is blocked. Can't go that way.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B01_m01: <BLN>The road to the east is blocked.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B02_m01_001: Heading to Dagsion, I hear?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B02_m01_002: That's an easy journey. It's due south. Can't\nmiss it!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B02_m01: <BLN>The way to Dagsion?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B03_m01_001: Is Esmeralda really leaving? I'm going to miss her.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B03_m01_002: I mean, you can't blame her. I'd leave this place too,\nif it was me.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B03_m01: <BLN>I'll miss her.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B04_m01_001: We gave that Randa and his goons a good beating\nbefore they ran off!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B04_m01_002: Can't believe Randa almost destroyed this village in\nsome fool ploy to make Esme his woman!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B04_m01: <BLN>Unbelievable!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B05_m01_001: All that sea-beast meat got shared out between\nthe villagers.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B05_m01_002: More than you could eat! Tasty too.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B05_m01_003: Thank you so much, stranger!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B05_m01: <BLN>Tasty!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B06_m01_001: Looks like it's safe to fish these waters again. What\na relief! We have to make up for lost time.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B06_m01: <BLN>And all's well.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B07_m01_001: Truth is, everybody was afraid of Randa.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c03_B07_m01_002: He used his clout as the headman's son to get away\nwith murder.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c03_B07_m01: <BLN>Good riddance, Randa!